00:25:05.780 --> 00:25:10.320
I don't think we'll be able to get him to give up his life.

00:25:10.320 --> 00:25:13.090
Captain, will you let me take care of him?

00:25:13.090 --> 00:25:14.440
I don't think so.

00:25:14.440 --> 00:25:16.100
I understand.

00:25:16.100 --> 00:25:18.230
But you're alone.

00:25:18.230 --> 00:25:25.710
I'm in Shibuya.

00:25:25.710 --> 00:25:28.240
He hasn't shown up yet.

00:25:28.240 --> 00:25:29.670
What about the others?

00:25:30.440 --> 00:25:31.440
No, not at all.

00:25:32.080 --> 00:25:34.100
I'll call you later.

00:25:34.450 --> 00:25:35.090
Yes.

00:25:36.830 --> 00:25:38.970
Oh, brother!

00:25:39.070 --> 00:25:40.050
You must be bored.

00:25:40.340 --> 00:25:41.560
No, I'm not.

00:25:41.740 --> 00:25:43.240
I'm really tired.

00:25:43.520 --> 00:25:45.540
Don't say that.

00:25:45.700 --> 00:25:46.840
How about a cup of tea?

00:25:46.900 --> 00:25:49.400
Sure, I'll wait for you.

00:25:49.460 --> 00:25:57.290
- Welcome. - Welcome.

00:25:57.540 --> 00:26:00.000
- You're still here? - Yes, it's been 10 minutes.

00:26:00.030 --> 00:26:01.360
It's too early for that.

00:26:01.520 --> 00:26:03.680
I'll put you in bed in the meantime.

00:26:03.860 --> 00:26:05.510
I won't put you in bed.

00:26:05.560 --> 00:26:08.260
- What? - I'll put you in this way.

00:26:08.340 --> 00:26:12.270
- What are you doing? - I'm putting you in a blue mount.

00:26:13.460 --> 00:26:17.830
- What's that? - Even if you're my brother, I can't put you in bed.

00:26:18.060 --> 00:26:20.930
- You're so mean. - You're late.

00:26:22.680 --> 00:26:24.390
- May I come in? - Of course.

00:26:24.700 --> 00:26:27.050
- This is my brother. - Is that so?

00:26:27.260 --> 00:26:28.930
- I'm Murai. - Hello.

00:26:30.000 --> 00:26:33.220
You know, my brother thinks you're his boyfriend.

00:26:33.300 --> 00:26:34.920
Hey, stop it.

00:26:35.000 --> 00:26:36.080
I'm sorry.

00:26:36.100 --> 00:26:38.130
But he's a brave man.

00:26:38.160 --> 00:26:40.530
We're going back to Northern Europe.

00:26:40.770 --> 00:26:42.950
-Oh, the meteorite survey. -Yes.

00:26:43.030 --> 00:26:44.400
Did you find anything?

00:26:44.480 --> 00:26:48.150
The results of the analysis show it was just a rock.

00:26:48.290 --> 00:26:51.800
But it's a very mysterious power.

00:26:51.900 --> 00:26:53.990
It's a myth from the 20th century.

00:26:54.070 --> 00:26:55.190
-Blue Man. -Yes.

00:26:55.510 --> 00:26:58.610
It's more surprising than the progeny's prophecy.

00:26:58.610 --> 00:27:00.000
Yesterday,

00:27:00.000 --> 00:27:04.670
Suddenly, a forbidden man appears in front of the castle.

00:27:04.670 --> 00:27:09.530
He calls the tourists to go down the hill.

00:27:09.530 --> 00:27:12.530
This is the center of the castle.

00:27:18.470 --> 00:27:24.260
Everyone, you have to go down this hill right now.

00:27:24.260 --> 00:27:30.000
You don't know that you are in great danger.

00:27:30.540 --> 00:27:32.300
Are you saying it will explode too?

00:27:32.300 --> 00:27:34.080
It won't explode.

00:27:34.080 --> 00:27:37.650
With the volcanic gas that has accumulated nearby,

00:27:37.650 --> 00:27:40.340
Radon will come back to life.

00:27:40.340 --> 00:27:42.110
- Radon? - Radon?

00:27:42.110 --> 00:27:44.370
This is all so creepy. Let's go home.

00:27:44.370 --> 00:27:46.810
Don't worry about what Kichigai says.

00:27:46.810 --> 00:27:48.210
I'll be with you.

00:27:48.210 --> 00:27:49.250
Oh!

00:27:49.250 --> 00:27:50.720
My waist!

00:27:50.720 --> 00:28:00.000
- That's no good. - Hey, what are we going to do?

00:28:00.510 --> 00:28:03.010
It's a gift from the bottom of my heart.

00:28:03.110 --> 00:28:04.990
But it's a bit too expensive.

00:28:05.090 --> 00:28:05.940
But...

00:28:06.170 --> 00:28:08.000
What do you think? Shall we pick it up?

00:28:08.430 --> 00:28:10.480
It costs 700 yen.

00:28:10.540 --> 00:28:11.340
What do you think?

00:28:11.440 --> 00:28:12.480
700 yen?

00:28:12.880 --> 00:28:14.310
No, 500 yen.

00:28:15.390 --> 00:28:16.130
Yes!

00:28:16.200 --> 00:28:18.000
200 yen! 200 yen! What do you think?

00:28:18.100 --> 00:28:18.820
200 yen?

00:28:19.220 --> 00:28:20.300
Then I'll take it.

00:28:20.400 --> 00:28:21.800
Really? Then...

00:28:28.570 --> 00:28:29.570
Stop it.

00:28:30.320 --> 00:28:31.220
I'm going back to my home.

00:28:31.220 --> 00:28:34.100
Shut up!

00:28:34.100 --> 00:28:34.960
Shut up!

00:28:34.960 --> 00:28:35.960
Don't get in my way!

00:28:35.960 --> 00:28:36.960
Stop it!

00:28:36.960 --> 00:28:38.870
Stop it!

00:29:32.400 --> 00:29:34.360
- -

00:30:58.250 --> 00:31:00.000
われわれの来たことは秘密になっているのだ。

00:31:00.510 --> 00:31:03.400
Of course. I had a hotel in the hotel.

00:31:03.400 --> 00:31:05.710
Okay. Then the queen?

00:31:05.710 --> 00:31:07.910
No, she's a male.

00:31:07.910 --> 00:31:12.320
It's a bad idea. But it's not going to be a lie.

00:31:12.320 --> 00:31:14.280
The police are checking.

00:31:14.280 --> 00:31:18.850
That's not that. It's too many cases.

00:31:18.850 --> 00:31:23.210
Next, the police department said, "The mountain of Alps is also known as the average of the Alps."

00:31:23.210 --> 00:31:26.980
"It's also known as the average of the Alps."

00:31:26.980 --> 00:31:29.800
The big cave in the Kasm沢 is...

00:31:30.090 --> 00:31:34.290
The investigation has been carried out to ensure the risk of explosion.

00:31:34.410 --> 00:31:38.800
The investigation team is not allowed to enter and leave the mountain.

00:31:38.840 --> 00:31:41.260
The investigation team is not allowed to enter and leave the mountain.

00:31:42.740 --> 00:31:44.880
- I'm off. - Wait.

00:31:45.230 --> 00:31:48.370
The light is getting stronger.

00:31:49.260 --> 00:31:52.370
But it's strange. There's nothing wrong with it today.

00:32:00.760 --> 00:32:02.920
Anyway, it's not a piece of cake.

00:32:02.920 --> 00:32:05.600
Shouldn't we pull it up?

00:32:05.640 --> 00:32:09.370
It's a rare opportunity for us.

00:32:10.590 --> 00:32:13.570
A material from space. Are you interested?

00:32:13.820 --> 00:32:15.960
I am. I am, but...

00:32:16.190 --> 00:32:18.660
It's been half a year since Bukimi came.

00:32:18.740 --> 00:32:22.530
Teacher, it's bigger than the last time.

00:32:22.720 --> 00:32:25.240
The meteorite is as big as a balloon.

00:32:25.790 --> 00:32:27.430
We'll have to do some research.

00:32:38.090 --> 00:32:41.010
Can you say something to say goodbye?

00:32:41.010 --> 00:32:42.780
Thank you, everyone.

00:32:42.780 --> 00:32:45.890
We're going back to Infant Island.

00:32:45.890 --> 00:32:48.960
If you invite us again, will you come again?

00:32:48.960 --> 00:32:51.110
Yes, I'd love to.

00:32:51.110 --> 00:32:54.960
But if possible, I don't want to be too noisy.

00:32:54.960 --> 00:32:57.400
Speaking of noise, what about Lado?

00:32:57.400 --> 00:33:00.000
I don't know where he is now, but I'll tell you with a telepathy.

00:33:00.000 --> 00:33:03.800
Telepathy is not a prophecy.

00:33:03.800 --> 00:33:06.200
We can't tell you anything.

00:33:06.200 --> 00:33:08.680
But Radon will appear.

00:33:14.750 --> 00:33:22.010
We can't do this.

00:33:22.010 --> 00:33:23.180
He's in.

00:33:23.180 --> 00:33:24.180
It's the Forbidden One.

00:33:24.180 --> 00:33:28.060
Captain, the Forbidden One has appeared.

00:33:28.060 --> 00:33:29.800
The Forbidden One?

00:33:30.440 --> 00:33:32.900
- We're not allowed to leave. - We can't leave.

00:33:32.980 --> 00:33:34.040
I'll give you orders.

00:33:34.200 --> 00:33:36.080
- Take over the shipyard. - Yes, sir.

00:33:36.110 --> 00:33:39.070
Why won't you listen to me?

00:33:39.410 --> 00:33:41.490
We can't leave this ship.

00:33:41.990 --> 00:33:42.960
Let's go.

00:33:43.390 --> 00:33:44.470
Who are you?

00:33:44.540 --> 00:33:45.970
I'm your friend.

00:33:46.040 --> 00:33:48.310
- Excuse me. - Excuse me.

00:33:48.810 --> 00:33:50.320
You're dismissed.

00:33:50.390 --> 00:33:51.760
Please wait.

00:33:51.820 --> 00:33:54.050
I'll take care of him.

00:33:54.130 --> 00:33:56.470
Nao, wait.

00:34:02.680 --> 00:34:04.850
- I found it. - It's from Kinseijin.

00:34:04.920 --> 00:34:06.340
- The princess. - What?

00:34:06.340 --> 00:34:19.460
Why did you want to sell it?

00:34:35.790 --> 00:34:39.220
- Where did you get it? - I didn't steal anything.

00:34:39.760 --> 00:34:42.550
I'm a good fisherman.

00:34:43.200 --> 00:34:46.960
- So where did you get it? - I found it.

00:34:48.170 --> 00:34:50.980
In my coat, jacket and pants.

00:34:51.860 --> 00:34:55.540
- Where? - On the beach.

00:34:56.180 --> 00:34:59.920
- The beach? - Yes.

00:35:00.410 --> 00:35:05.060
While returning from the ship, I saw him floating on the sea.

00:35:05.480 --> 00:35:07.880
That's when I found out.

00:35:07.970 --> 00:35:12.130
- You didn't think it was strange? - No, it wasn't strange.

00:35:12.490 --> 00:35:14.980
I thought I'd find him as soon as I got to the port.

00:35:15.210 --> 00:35:17.990
But when I got there, he was gone.

00:35:21.560 --> 00:35:25.510
Do you know anyone with arms?

00:35:32.400 --> 00:35:43.030
- Wait. - Let's have a talk.

00:35:43.110 --> 00:35:44.150
- Excuse me. - What?

00:35:44.780 --> 00:35:47.280
- I don't know anything. - I didn't steal it.

00:35:47.620 --> 00:35:57.080
I'm just a reference. What do you think?

00:36:00.000 --> 00:36:03.620
He was on a plane that exploded into space.

00:36:04.540 --> 00:36:07.250
He was the only one who survived.

00:36:07.780 --> 00:36:09.090
Do you think it's strange?

00:36:09.400 --> 00:36:11.840
I think so too. What do you think?

00:36:12.180 --> 00:36:16.580
Well, he almost gave himself up, but no one took it seriously.

00:36:17.380 --> 00:36:19.650
But there was one person who said something funny.

00:36:19.950 --> 00:36:20.420
Who?

00:36:20.650 --> 00:36:21.920
The president of the Uchigen Club.

00:36:22.140 --> 00:36:26.790
Well, he was saved by falling into the abyss.

00:36:27.890 --> 00:36:29.800
You may not know him,

00:36:31.240 --> 00:36:36.530
In this space, there is a world that is different from the one we live in.

00:36:37.590 --> 00:36:41.380
He was shocked by the explosion and screamed into space.

00:36:41.800 --> 00:36:44.080
He fell into it and was saved.

00:36:47.220 --> 00:37:00.000
- Welcome. - Welcome.

00:37:00.000 --> 00:37:01.760
- Thank you. - Is your usual room open?

00:37:01.760 --> 00:37:04.000
Unfortunately, it's closed.

00:37:04.000 --> 00:37:06.040
How about the room on the other side?

00:37:06.040 --> 00:37:09.290
Room 384, okay.

00:37:09.290 --> 00:37:13.210
This time, we'll use the old-fashioned Le Portage.

00:37:13.210 --> 00:37:15.590
Okay, let's go.

00:37:39.440 --> 00:37:41.620
Let's go.

00:37:46.400 --> 00:37:50.370
- How is he? - I don't know. But he looks like him.

00:37:50.690 --> 00:37:52.170
- I'll do it. - Wait.

00:37:52.480 --> 00:37:57.000
If you see me and the other guy's face, you might be a different person.

00:37:57.100 --> 00:38:00.000
The news department. Is the chief here?

00:38:01.500 --> 00:38:04.690
Naoko is with Kin Seijin right now.

00:38:04.690 --> 00:38:06.040
Really?

00:38:06.040 --> 00:38:08.510
Yes, she's at the hotel.

00:38:08.510 --> 00:38:09.910
It's okay.

00:38:09.910 --> 00:38:11.530
I have a favor to ask.

00:38:11.530 --> 00:38:14.490
Please help me change into Kin Seijin's clothes.

00:38:14.490 --> 00:38:21.660
Yes, take your time tonight.

00:38:21.660 --> 00:38:26.060
Is there anyone else?

00:38:26.060 --> 00:38:29.060
No one else, just the two of you.

00:38:39.050 --> 00:38:40.120
Hello.

00:38:40.120 --> 00:38:42.730
Did you not fly on the ship?

00:38:42.730 --> 00:38:44.090
Why?

00:38:44.090 --> 00:38:47.630
I feel like I know this person.

00:38:47.630 --> 00:38:49.010
I know.

00:38:49.010 --> 00:38:54.750
I don't have to fly on that ship.

00:38:54.750 --> 00:38:57.330
Hey, why don't you fly?

00:39:01.880 --> 00:39:04.050
Did something happen to that ship?

00:39:04.050 --> 00:39:06.440
It's too late.

00:39:58.730 --> 00:39:59.410
It's a monster!

00:40:02.400 --> 00:40:04.550
It's 0.8% bigger than the last time.

00:40:05.490 --> 00:40:06.700
That's surprising.

00:40:06.810 --> 00:40:08.860
I've never heard of a meteor.

00:40:08.990 --> 00:40:11.020
But it's getting bigger.

00:40:11.420 --> 00:40:12.760
How's the situation?

00:40:13.050 --> 00:40:14.430
No reaction at all.

00:40:14.570 --> 00:40:16.000
I don't feel a thing.

00:40:16.780 --> 00:40:19.410
Why don't we pull it out?

00:40:19.600 --> 00:40:21.000
We're the only ones who can do it.

00:40:25.080 --> 00:40:26.220
The situation has developed!

00:40:26.360 --> 00:40:27.200
It's an observation!

00:40:55.440 --> 00:41:00.000
My duty is to let as many people as possible know of the crisis on Earth.

00:41:01.980 --> 00:41:17.950
Even if you're here, you can talk to people all over Japan.

00:41:17.950 --> 00:41:27.900
I'll be right over there.

00:41:27.900 --> 00:41:29.170
Wait a minute.

00:41:29.170 --> 00:41:30.000
I'm here.

00:41:55.150 --> 00:41:59.380
- What is it? - Nothing.

00:42:01.280 --> 00:42:03.250
I've made you a princess.

00:42:03.250 --> 00:42:06.180
A princess? I don't know her.

00:42:06.180 --> 00:42:18.000
Princess, it's been a long time.

00:42:18.000 --> 00:42:20.670
I'm a Kinseijin.

00:42:20.670 --> 00:42:23.090
Don't be a fool.

00:42:23.090 --> 00:42:25.290
You're the princess of the Sergius Empire.

00:42:25.290 --> 00:42:27.370
I don't know anything like that.

00:42:27.370 --> 00:42:30.000
Anyway, I'll see you tomorrow.

00:42:30.000 --> 00:42:33.580
I must leave this place immediately.

00:42:33.710 --> 00:42:37.020
You don't have to. What if you do?

00:42:37.170 --> 00:42:39.920
Wait. This isn't Seldia.

00:42:41.140 --> 00:42:58.030
If you're acting, you must remember this place.

00:43:00.000 --> 00:43:02.720
It's the sword that killed your father's life.

00:43:02.870 --> 00:43:05.670
Give it back to me, brother!

00:43:06.670 --> 00:43:08.880
Naoko, I know what you're talking about.

00:43:09.460 --> 00:43:10.980
The victim is the princess.

00:43:12.010 --> 00:43:13.920
I know you took her out of Yokohama.

00:43:14.040 --> 00:43:15.110
- Here, take it. - No.

00:43:15.680 --> 00:43:19.010
Brother, don't be so stubborn. I'll call the police.

00:43:19.960 --> 00:43:22.600
Idiot, did you forget that I'm a police officer?

00:43:23.320 --> 00:43:25.480
If you don't listen, I'll arrest you.

00:43:25.690 --> 00:43:28.890
No, what are you going to do with that princess?

00:43:29.090 --> 00:43:30.000
Of course I'll protect her.

00:43:30.800 --> 00:43:33.140
I'll send her back when she recovers.

00:43:33.410 --> 00:43:35.620
She needs treatment.

00:43:36.750 --> 00:43:43.250
- Okay. - Princess, what happened to your bracelet?

00:43:44.490 --> 00:43:48.480
- Bracelet? - That's right.

00:43:48.770 --> 00:43:55.890
Remember, you were wearing a princess bracelet.

00:43:57.650 --> 00:43:59.220
Remember the bracelet.

00:44:01.630 --> 00:44:09.890
- I'm not a human being. - But what is it?

00:44:09.920 --> 00:44:16.760
- I may have a handkerchief. - Why don't you have it now?

00:44:16.830 --> 00:44:22.470
It's useless. Why can't the earthlings wake up?

00:44:22.510 --> 00:44:28.070
- Where did you get it? - A poor man gave it to me.

00:44:42.160 --> 00:44:42.960
Come on, Özkan!

00:45:25.500 --> 00:45:27.460
Nako, turn on the light.

00:45:30.890 --> 00:45:34.240
Well, you two. Thank you.

00:45:39.060 --> 00:45:40.140
Oh, yes.

00:45:55.640 --> 00:45:57.240
Oh, that book.

00:45:57.760 --> 00:45:59.880
You can read books in the dark?

00:46:00.640 --> 00:46:02.400
I'm from Kinsen.

00:46:03.290 --> 00:46:05.670
Nako, let's get out of here. It's dangerous.

00:46:05.790 --> 00:46:06.740
Where are you going?

00:46:06.990 --> 00:46:09.410
I told you the treatment is ready. Hurry up.

00:49:00.120 --> 00:49:01.640
It's Dr. Tsukamoto's lab.

00:49:01.830 --> 00:49:03.240
Tsukamoto's lab?

00:49:03.310 --> 00:49:04.580
He's a psychiatrist.

00:49:05.120 --> 00:49:06.950
He's been a great help to the police.

00:49:07.520 --> 00:49:09.920
Thanks to Dr. Tsukamoto, many things have been solved.

00:49:11.800 --> 00:49:27.910
Fifteen. Twenty.

00:49:34.410 --> 00:49:47.380
- Good. - Doctor, can you heal him?

00:49:48.080 --> 00:49:53.620
Heal him? He's not abnormal.

00:49:54.170 --> 00:49:56.280
He's just like normal people.

00:50:00.000 --> 00:50:03.020
Then why do you say he's a saint?

00:50:03.560 --> 00:50:07.140
Is he really a saint?

00:50:07.690 --> 00:50:09.160
Of course not.

00:50:09.260 --> 00:50:11.920
It's impossible to know from his mouth.

00:50:12.780 --> 00:50:16.820
The medicine I've been studying is a kind of hypnotic drug.

00:50:16.930 --> 00:50:20.440
I see.

00:50:20.540 --> 00:50:23.180
You still don't understand?

00:50:23.400 --> 00:50:26.730
At this rate, the Earth will be destroyed.

00:50:26.830 --> 00:50:29.700
It will become the star of death for King Ghidorah.

00:50:31.240 --> 00:50:32.210
King Ghidorah?

00:50:32.210 --> 00:50:40.130
It's a monster that destroyed the culture and science of the Golden Age.

00:50:40.130 --> 00:50:47.530
The Golden Age was far more prosperous than the current Earth.

00:50:47.530 --> 00:50:53.610
But for King Ghidorah, it became a star of death forever.

00:50:53.610 --> 00:50:59.090
Do you mean King Ghidorah will come to Earth?

00:50:59.090 --> 00:51:00.000
Yes.

00:51:01.210 --> 00:51:02.930
It's already here.

00:51:03.800 --> 00:51:08.100
And the end of the Earth is coming.

00:51:10.800 --> 00:51:12.200
You don't believe me, do you?

00:51:16.160 --> 00:51:18.660
I can tell from your eyes.

00:51:20.660 --> 00:51:23.500
It looks like this is being examined.

00:51:23.610 --> 00:51:25.960
Doctor, you shouldn't be so impressed.

00:51:26.790 --> 00:51:29.600
Now, good night.

00:51:31.850 --> 00:51:39.100
"Godzilla and Radon have moved from Hakone to Mt.Fuji."

00:51:39.100 --> 00:51:42.260
"Prepare to evacuate at any time."

00:55:25.500 --> 00:55:26.120
Hello, I'm Uri.

00:55:30.000 --> 00:55:41.680
King Ghidorah has appeared again in addition to Godzilla and Radon.

00:55:41.680 --> 00:55:50.150
What are the measures that the government can take against this?

00:55:50.150 --> 00:55:55.670
I'd like to hear from the Minister of Defense and the Prime Minister.

00:55:55.670 --> 00:55:57.840
Minister of Defense.

00:56:03.960 --> 00:56:14.190
The Japanese army is working hard to keep an eye on the actions of the Godzilla and Radon.

00:56:14.190 --> 00:56:30.000
The King Ghidorah is working hard to contact the International Alliance.

00:56:30.000 --> 00:56:31.740
You're not the only one who's asking questions.

00:56:31.740 --> 00:56:33.620
I'm asking you why you want to destroy it,

00:56:33.620 --> 00:56:36.070
whether you have the confidence to do it or not.

00:56:36.070 --> 00:56:39.660
Minister Oei.

00:56:39.660 --> 00:56:44.040
The problem is not the problem of Japan alone.

00:56:44.040 --> 00:56:47.940
It's the problem of the whole world.

00:56:47.940 --> 00:56:51.420
Do you have the courage to use nuclear weapons

00:56:51.420 --> 00:56:56.890
against Godzilla and Radon?

00:56:56.890 --> 00:57:00.000
There is no need to explain any more.

00:57:01.120 --> 00:57:04.400
I will do my best until the end.

00:57:04.400 --> 00:57:07.400
I'm waiting for heaven.

00:58:02.910 --> 00:58:06.790
Everyone, I have called someone without permission.

00:58:07.690 --> 00:58:10.950
As the Prime Minister said, it's time to get to the bottom of this.

00:58:11.120 --> 00:58:13.540
I'd like you to listen to what he has to say.

00:58:14.490 --> 00:58:15.190
Go ahead.

00:58:31.340 --> 00:58:40.350
This is Naoko Shindou of Toyo Broadcasting and these are the two from Infant Island.

00:58:40.350 --> 00:58:48.440
You didn't go back to the island, did you?

00:58:48.440 --> 00:58:51.450
No, I went with the prophet.

00:58:51.450 --> 00:58:52.600
The prophet?

00:58:52.600 --> 00:58:57.670
Where is that Shindou now?

00:58:57.670 --> 00:59:00.000
On Mt. Fuji.

00:59:00.000 --> 00:59:02.210
We're at the Tsukamoto Research Institute.

00:59:02.360 --> 00:59:04.220
Tsukamoto Research Institute.

00:59:04.640 --> 00:59:09.290
As you know, Mosra has fought against Godzilla once.

00:59:09.750 --> 00:59:13.580
It may be primitive and not scientific,

00:59:13.920 --> 00:59:18.320
but we wanted to get Mosra's cooperation through them.

00:59:18.840 --> 00:59:20.090
What do you think?

00:59:20.450 --> 00:59:22.530
What do you think, ladies?

00:59:26.720 --> 00:59:27.520
No?

00:59:30.600 --> 00:59:35.480
Even if Mothra fights, King Ghidorah won't be able to defeat him.

00:59:35.480 --> 00:59:40.320
So, we can't protect the peace of the Infant Island from King Ghidorah?

00:59:40.320 --> 00:59:43.950
Yes, we're in trouble too.

00:59:43.950 --> 00:59:45.200
But...

00:59:45.200 --> 00:59:48.480
But? But what?

00:59:48.480 --> 00:59:50.370
There's only one hope.

00:59:50.370 --> 00:59:53.070
What is it?

00:59:53.070 --> 01:00:00.000
To join forces with Godzilla, Radon, and Mothra.

01:00:00.000 --> 01:00:06.770
If we join forces, we might be able to defeat King Ghidorah.

01:00:06.770 --> 01:00:10.090
But who's going to persuade Godzilla and Radon?

01:00:10.090 --> 01:00:11.750
We'll call Mothra.

01:00:11.750 --> 01:00:16.320
We'll have Mothra talk to them.

01:00:16.320 --> 01:00:22.040
But if Godzilla and Radon don't agree, it'll be over.

01:00:22.040 --> 01:00:23.170
It's Ghidorah!

01:01:28.220 --> 01:01:28.840
Please.

01:02:00.280 --> 01:02:01.380
my

01:03:01.790 --> 01:03:02.440
- Bye.

01:04:08.570 --> 01:04:10.870
It's completely flooded.

01:04:10.920 --> 01:04:19.810
Close the curtains and get ready to leave.

01:04:30.000 --> 01:04:36.710
You may be able to tell the story of the princess.

01:04:36.830 --> 01:04:44.120
You are asleep, but your mind is awake.

01:04:44.240 --> 01:04:47.310
Who are you?

01:04:48.110 --> 01:04:54.790
I am a Kinseijin.

01:04:55.370 --> 01:05:00.000
Is that so? But Kinseijin...

01:05:00.000 --> 01:05:05.310
I'm sure he's not on Earth, but why are you here?

01:05:05.310 --> 01:05:12.810
On the Day of the Immortal, I escaped to Earth.

01:05:12.810 --> 01:05:16.000
- When? - 5,000 years ago.

01:05:16.000 --> 01:05:20.360
5,000 years ago? Why did you live for 5,000 years?

01:05:20.360 --> 01:05:24.750
Of course I couldn't have lived.

01:05:24.750 --> 01:05:30.000
I was born on Earth as an Immortal.

01:05:30.000 --> 01:05:37.410
But as time passed, he lost all of his talent.

01:05:37.410 --> 01:05:40.410
He lost a part of his instincts.

01:05:40.410 --> 01:05:42.510
A part of his instincts?

01:05:42.510 --> 01:05:47.330
His instinct to predict the future.

01:05:47.330 --> 01:06:00.000
You're just like him.

01:06:00.160 --> 01:06:02.120
Do you believe he's the Prince of the Monkey?

01:06:02.500 --> 01:06:04.770
Of course. He used to be a prince.

01:06:07.320 --> 01:06:09.200
Let's try the shock therapy.

01:06:09.800 --> 01:06:11.090
Shock therapy?

01:06:17.990 --> 01:06:19.700
I'll turn it off.

01:06:20.000 --> 01:06:21.160
I've finally figured it out.

01:06:21.390 --> 01:06:22.890
The mission is to follow him.

01:06:29.470 --> 01:06:30.000
Doctor.

01:06:30.280 --> 01:06:32.400
- What should we do? - What do you mean?

01:06:32.570 --> 01:06:34.870
- We can't give up. - It's Godzilla!

01:06:38.850 --> 01:06:43.090
Follow orders and evacuate immediately.

01:06:43.180 --> 01:06:45.430
Godzilla and Radon are approaching.

01:06:45.430 --> 01:06:50.610
Follow orders of the fire brigade and evacuate immediately.

01:07:00.030 --> 01:07:02.430
Turn up the voltage. 500 volts.

01:07:02.510 --> 01:07:03.150
Yes, sir.

01:07:03.230 --> 01:07:05.000
If you go any further, the patient will be in danger.

01:07:05.150 --> 01:07:05.990
Yes, sir.

01:07:06.130 --> 01:07:06.560
Hush!

01:07:30.000 --> 01:07:31.540
Even if you don't, they'll do it for you.

01:07:31.540 --> 01:07:44.790
10,000 volts.

01:07:44.790 --> 01:07:48.730
That won't be enough.

01:07:48.730 --> 01:07:49.810
Let's check again.

01:07:49.810 --> 01:07:53.040
It's coming!

01:07:53.040 --> 01:07:53.940
Run, run!

01:08:25.120 --> 01:08:27.680
- No problem. - OK, let's begin.

01:08:34.090 --> 01:08:35.680
I'm sure it's 500 volts.

01:08:35.780 --> 01:08:36.470
It's OK.

01:08:37.300 --> 01:08:45.270
What do you mean?

01:08:45.380 --> 01:08:46.610
Is it power outage?

01:08:46.840 --> 01:08:48.130
I'll go take a look.

01:08:48.150 --> 01:08:57.840
This is it!

01:09:02.460 --> 01:09:16.710
-What are you doing? Don't move. -Take it easy.

01:09:34.380 --> 01:09:35.120
Yes.

01:10:08.730 --> 01:10:11.400
- Is there anyone who can come back? - They're coming.

01:10:11.410 --> 01:10:13.370
- What? - What are you talking about?

01:10:13.450 --> 01:10:15.300
- Let's go! - Yes, sir.

01:11:33.070 --> 01:11:33.520
Ah!

01:12:14.360 --> 01:12:16.700
Doctor, what should we do with the people in the laboratory?

01:12:16.700 --> 01:12:18.800
We'll take care of it later.

01:12:18.800 --> 01:12:21.760
Hey, Ms. Moss, what are you doing here?

01:12:21.760 --> 01:12:23.510
We're here to fight King Ghidorah.

01:12:23.510 --> 01:12:24.900
What are you doing?

01:12:24.900 --> 01:12:27.490
If you don't run away now, this will be the land of death.

01:12:27.490 --> 01:12:30.000
So, what's the result of the treatment?

01:12:30.440 --> 01:12:32.730
As you can see, it's an alien.

01:12:36.090 --> 01:12:39.120
Please stop the car.

01:12:39.150 --> 01:12:41.110
It's Mothra. Mothra is coming.

01:12:41.890 --> 01:12:47.250
Now get out of the car. Hurry, hurry.

01:12:47.490 --> 01:12:48.470
Let's go up.

01:15:14.590 --> 01:15:24.000
- He's saying something. - Is he?

01:15:24.960 --> 01:15:28.040
Don't push yourself. You've never learned to be a monster.

01:15:30.760 --> 01:15:31.890
What are you saying now?

01:15:31.890 --> 01:15:37.840
I'm trying to persuade him, but I don't think he's going to listen to me.

01:15:37.840 --> 01:15:40.990
Stop fighting, let's all work together.

01:15:40.990 --> 01:15:44.370
He's trying to protect the earth from King Ghidorah's violence.

01:15:44.370 --> 01:15:46.540
Did Godzilla and Radon agree?

01:15:46.540 --> 01:15:48.760
No, Godzilla and Radon, too.

01:15:48.760 --> 01:15:50.240
It's what we know.

01:15:50.240 --> 01:15:52.810
I'm telling you to do it on your own.

01:15:52.810 --> 01:15:54.600
I hate you.

01:15:54.600 --> 01:15:56.480
Damn it.

01:15:56.480 --> 01:15:58.190
Godzilla says this.

01:15:58.190 --> 01:16:00.000
The reason we save humans.

01:16:00.030 --> 01:16:04.510
"Human beings are always bullying us," he says.

01:16:04.610 --> 01:16:07.620
Radon also says, "That's right, that's right."

01:16:11.650 --> 01:16:12.910
Move!

01:16:12.970 --> 01:16:16.590
Bastard! You're not the only one who ran away!

01:16:20.490 --> 01:16:22.450
It's Gido!

01:16:22.510 --> 01:16:23.360
Gido!

01:16:56.520 --> 01:17:00.000
I'll just leave it alone.

01:17:00.320 --> 01:17:04.640
Godzilla and Radon both apologize to each other.

01:17:06.340 --> 01:17:15.400
They don't give up and try to convince each other.

01:17:15.400 --> 01:17:17.380
Damn it.

01:17:17.380 --> 01:17:19.330
It's not just humans who don't understand.

01:18:00.090 --> 01:18:00.550
Yes.

01:18:11.780 --> 01:18:26.010
This Earth is not only for humans, it's for everyone.

01:18:26.010 --> 01:18:29.700
Isn't it natural for us to fight to protect this Earth?

01:18:30.120 --> 01:18:32.960
Now that we've talked about it, let's get this over with.

01:18:38.680 --> 01:18:40.260
I don't think we can do this.

01:18:40.260 --> 01:18:42.300
The stairs are a dead end.

01:18:42.300 --> 01:18:44.780
Mothra is going to fight on his own.

01:18:44.780 --> 01:18:46.130
What?

01:18:46.130 --> 01:18:47.440
That's impossible.

01:18:56.230 --> 01:18:57.760
Go, Kira!

01:18:57.760 --> 01:18:59.170
Go, Kura!

01:18:59.170 --> 01:19:00.000
Go, Radom!

01:20:00.640 --> 01:20:03.320
We're going to fight with Radon!

01:20:03.320 --> 01:20:06.300
Hey, Lanzer, the princess isn't here!

01:20:06.300 --> 01:20:07.850
What?

01:20:07.850 --> 01:20:08.620
Let's go.

01:20:08.620 --> 01:20:12.930
Yes, I'll go this way.

01:21:00.830 --> 01:21:01.890
What's going on?

01:22:43.760 --> 01:22:52.980
Oh God of creation, please save this planet from ruin and save us from the fate of the planet of death.

01:23:00.120 --> 01:23:01.420
Ojo!

01:23:05.800 --> 01:23:09.190
Ojo, stand up!

01:23:09.190 --> 01:23:10.230
Stand up!

01:23:10.960 --> 01:23:12.070
Ojo!

01:23:12.070 --> 01:23:13.470
Ojo!

01:23:13.470 --> 01:23:14.240
Ojo!

01:24:24.760 --> 01:24:28.160
I'm sorry. I didn't mean to...

01:24:30.640 --> 01:24:32.380
Have you noticed?

01:24:32.380 --> 01:24:34.080
Who are you?

01:24:34.080 --> 01:24:35.790
I'm a Japanese police officer.

01:24:35.790 --> 01:24:37.460
And your bodyguard.

01:24:42.970 --> 01:24:44.690
Don't worry.

01:25:40.910 --> 01:25:42.450
I'll call the police.

01:28:18.110 --> 01:28:19.240
Calm down.

01:28:37.200 --> 01:28:41.360
All of them. All of them.

01:30:08.160 --> 01:30:10.210
I don't know if it's time to say goodbye.

01:30:10.210 --> 01:30:15.840
Did I really say that I was from the Forbidden Land?

01:30:15.840 --> 01:30:16.890
Yes, you did.

01:30:16.890 --> 01:30:19.540
The state of mind you had at that time was certain.

01:30:19.540 --> 01:30:24.490
Besides, you showed us the power of prophecy.

01:30:24.490 --> 01:30:28.130
Then why did I return to the royal palace?

01:30:28.130 --> 01:30:29.960
It was a shock.

01:30:31.630 --> 01:30:34.780
I'm glad I was shot.

01:30:35.070 --> 01:30:39.950
Then, will the instinct of the Forbidden Beings revive again?

01:30:40.080 --> 01:30:43.370
I can't say anything.

01:30:44.650 --> 01:30:48.080
This is beyond human ability.

01:31:06.040 --> 01:31:07.560
Thank you, Shindou.

01:31:08.010 --> 01:31:11.170
You saved me three times.

01:31:11.400 --> 01:31:12.770
Three times?

01:31:13.190 --> 01:31:22.150
When I was shot at by the hotel and the research institute.

01:31:22.320 --> 01:31:26.240
Do you remember the hotel and the research institute?

01:31:26.920 --> 01:31:30.000
I can remember everything else.

01:31:31.660 --> 01:31:34.840
But that's all I can think of.

01:31:37.460 --> 01:31:45.010
You won't forget me, will you?

01:31:46.080 --> 01:31:49.520
I wish you all the best.

01:32:01.120 --> 01:32:01.960
Thank you.

01:32:32.750 --> 01:32:33.270
Thank you.
